            "detailed_description": "<strong>SURVIVE THE APOCALYPSE</strong>: Scavenge for supplies, hunt for food, and build shelter in a world overrun by zombies.<br><br><strong>EXPLORE MASSIVE LEVELS</strong>: Travel by air, land, and sea while discovering hidden secrets and NPCs to help and trade with.<br><br><strong>BUILD YOUR HOME</strong>: Fortify your base before heading back out to retrieve airdrops, scout deadzones, and battle hordes of supernatural undead.<br><br><strong>COOPERATE OR FIGHT</strong>: Team up with friendly players to arrest the bandits, or face-off in intense PvP raids.<br><br><strong>TRULY FREE-TO-PLAY</strong>: No pay-to-win mechanics, only cosmetic items to further customize your character.<br><br><strong>ENDLESS CREATIVITY</strong>: Create, share, and experience custom maps and mods through the Steam Workshop.<br><br><strong>SOURCE CODE</strong>: From new features to total conversions, you can rebuild the game with source code and project files available on GitHub.",
            "about_the_game": "<strong>SURVIVE THE APOCALYPSE</strong>: Scavenge for supplies, hunt for food, and build shelter in a world overrun by zombies.<br><br><strong>EXPLORE MASSIVE LEVELS</strong>: Travel by air, land, and sea while discovering hidden secrets and NPCs to help and trade with.<br><br><strong>BUILD YOUR HOME</strong>: Fortify your base before heading back out to retrieve airdrops, scout deadzones, and battle hordes of supernatural undead.<br><br><strong>COOPERATE OR FIGHT</strong>: Team up with friendly players to arrest the bandits, or face-off in intense PvP raids.<br><br><strong>TRULY FREE-TO-PLAY</strong>: No pay-to-win mechanics, only cosmetic items to further customize your character.<br><br><strong>ENDLESS CREATIVITY</strong>: Create, share, and experience custom maps and mods through the Steam Workshop.<br><br><strong>SOURCE CODE</strong>: From new features to total conversions, you can rebuild the game with source code and project files available on GitHub.",
            "short_description": "Unturned is an open-world zombie survival sandbox game. As one of the few not yet turned, you must fight to remain among the living.",
